    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="es6란-무엇인가">ES6란 무엇인가?</h2>
<p>ecmascript2015를</p>
<h2 id="es-history">ES history</h2>
<h3 id="es31999">ES3(1999)</h3>
<p>ie8까지 지원하는 자바스크립트</p>
<h3 id="es52009">ES5(2009)</h3>
<p>forEach, map, reduce, filter 등이 생김</p>
<h3 id="es6es2015">ES6(ES2015)</h3>
<p>let, const 등장. promise가 나온다</p>
<h3 id="es7es2016">ES7(ES2016)</h3>
<p>Array.includes 등장.</p>
<h3 id="es8es2017">ES8(ES2017)</h3>
<p>async, await 등장.</p>
<h3 id="es9es2018">ES9(ES2018)</h3>]]></description>
